        {
          "text": "Vutinia opi Daudi so pa uru, ’yo ra kini: Emi eri e’yo ma tia, ma adripi, azini ’ba mani ’diyi. Ma’iruni, ma osu ndra ma asia jo ava lizani sizu sanduku aziza Yehovanirini dri, pari Mungu amanirini pa ’bazuri dri indio Ma ovu ndra ngonde jo nde sizu ra ’bo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
