                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Te ti, Yehova Mungu Israeliniri epe ndra ma engazu ori’ba dria ma atini ma eselia ovuzu opiru Israeli ma drilia ’dani ’dani; erini Yudani pele ovuzu ’ba ’ba dri cepiriru ’borisi; te suru Yudani ma eselia eri pe ndra ori’ba ma atini, azini anzi ma atini ’diyi ma eselia eri ovu ayikosi ma ’bazu opiru ’ba Israelini dria ma ’drilia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
